Kaihi bundles data and fonts from third-party sources, in addition to its own code (see LICENSE).

## GeoIP country data (app/src/main/assets/geoip.dat)

Derived from the DB-IP "country-lite" database (https://db-ip.com), used under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

IP-to-country geolocation by DB-IP.com.

Repackaged into Xray's geoip.dat format by v2fly/geoip (https://github.com/v2fly/geoip), used
under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Trimmed to a small set of countries via the pinned generator config at
tools/geoip-dat/config.json.

## Geosite domain data (bundled at build time as geosite.dat)

Downloaded from v2fly/domain-list-community (https://github.com/v2fly/domain-list-community),
MIT License.

